  'l-tryptophan': { risk: IngredientRisk.Low, category: 'additives', explanation: 'Essential amino acid and serotonin precursor; FDA GRAS as a food additive (reversed ban in 1994 after 1989 EMS outbreak was traced to a specific manufacturer, not tryptophan itself) — safe at food-use levels.' },
